{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><i><strong>April Grove Demo</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a load off, enjoy the <i>April Grove</i> <i>Demo</i>!<br>Explore the scenery, chop a tree or two; the first two sections and the town of April Grove are yours to explore and savor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737320/extras/Chopping_GIF.gif?t=1749470439\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a peaceful world without a danger in sight. All that stands between you and greatness is your efforts and optimization. Gather logs, trade them for gold and purchase food, upgrades or even donate to the local wishing well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737320/extras/Characters_GIF.gif?t=1749470439\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each log gain experience and grow in your skill so that you can cut and clear the daunting trees with greater ease.\u00a0Don't worry about making it to the top for the demo, they bring out more for the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737320/extras/Places_GIF.gif?t=1749470439\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">April Grove lets you move at your own pace and do as you please, so chop chop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Features that <i>April Grove Demo</i>\u00a0has to offer:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the first two sections of the mystical forest and meet some of its citizens in its village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up the axe of the forester who came before. Take your woodcutting skill from 0 to full!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A section of a peaceful world and its OST to lose yourself in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily play in the background. Chop wood while you work for maximum gains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize for your style of play with the early (cheapest) foods, necklaces and axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a guy or a girl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet various animals to varying degrees of success.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>After you have explored everything that is available in the demo, wishlist the full game to know when it releases!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737320?t=1749470439","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3737320?t=1749470439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737320/d004e52368996dbfe7bca0a5260b467a3858c5e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749470439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737320/d004e52368996dbfe7bca0a5260b467a3858c5e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749470439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><i><strong>April Grove Demo</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a load off, enjoy the <i>April Grove</i> <i>Demo</i>!<br>Explore the scenery, chop a tree or two; the first two sections and the town of April Grove are yours to explore and savor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737320/extras/Chopping_GIF.gif?t=1749470439\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s a peaceful world without a danger in sight. All that stands between you and greatness is your efforts and optimization. Gather logs, trade them for gold and purchase food, upgrades or even donate to the local wishing well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737320/extras/Characters_GIF.gif?t=1749470439\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each log gain experience and grow in your skill so that you can cut and clear the daunting trees with greater ease.\u00a0Don't worry about making it to the top for the demo, they bring out more for the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737320/extras/Places_GIF.gif?t=1749470439\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">April Grove lets you move at your own pace and do as you please, so chop chop!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Features that <i>April Grove Demo</i>\u00a0has to offer:</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the first two sections of the mystical forest and meet some of its citizens in its village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick up the axe of the forester who came before. Take your woodcutting skill from 0 to full!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A section of a peaceful world and its OST to lose yourself in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easily play in the background. Chop wood while you work for maximum gains!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize for your style of play with the early (cheapest) foods, necklaces and axes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a guy or a girl!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet various animals to varying degrees of success.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>After you have explored everything that is available in the demo, wishlist the full game to know when it releases!</strong></p>","developers":["Colorgrave"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3622260","name":"April Grove"},"genres":[{"des